WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Dissolving sky-bridge over a forgotten city, desperate.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.300 align:center
Lyra: Almost there!

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.600 align:center
Echo Shard: Why cling to this?

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.900 align:center
Lyra: Mine! Get back!

5
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.200 align:center
Kael: The bridge... it won't hold.

6
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.500 align:center
Lyra: No! Stay back!

7
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:13.800 align:center
Echo Shard: Such fragile noise.

8
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:21.100 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Crumbling upper levels of a forgotten city, leading to a precarious ledge, urgent.

9
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.400 align:center
Lyra: Too wide. No time.

10
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.700 align:center
Kael: A small spark...

11
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.000 align:center
Lyra: But... it's still me.

12
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.300 align:center
Echo Shard: Release the burden.

13
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.600 align:center
Lyra: There! Go!

14
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:30.900 align:center
Lyra: Now!

15
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:39.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Precarious ledge overlooking the void, leading to a vertical descent, tense.

16
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.500 align:center
Lyra: Handhold! Gone!

17
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.800 align:center
Kael: Lower... left...

18
00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.100 align:center
Lyra: Kael? Speak!

19
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.400 align:center
Echo Shard: The void welcomes all.

20
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:46.700 align:center
Kael: Don't look down...

21
00:00:46.1000 --> 00:00:47.1000 align:center
Lyra: Almost there!

22
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:55.300 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Shifting marketplace, stalls made of ephemeral memories, dread.

23
00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:56.600 align:center
Lyra: What is that?

24
00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.900 align:center
Kael: The Weaver. It remembers me.

25
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Another loose thread.

26
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.500 align:center
Lyra: So big... so cold.

27
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:03.800 align:center
Kael: Run, Lyra.

28
00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:10.100 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Marketplace under Loom attack, collapsing memory-archway, desperate.

29
00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.400 align:center
Lyra: Tendril! Moving!

30
00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:12.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Untangle. Purify.

31
00:01:12.1000 --> 00:01:13.1000 align:center
Lyra: Not this one!

32
00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:15.300 align:center
Kael: Distract... quickly!

33
00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:16.600 align:center
Lyra: Take THIS!

34
00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:17.900 align:center
Lyra: Go! Go!

35
00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:24.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling library/archive section of the marketplace, tense.

36
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.500 align:center
Lyra: Path gone! Falling!

37
00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:26.800 align:center
Kael: Use... the archive.

38
00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.100 align:center
Lyra: Another? So much gone.

39
00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Resistance is futile.

40
00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:31.700 align:center
Lyra: Hold! Just hold!

41
00:01:32.1000 --> 00:01:38.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Ancient plaza, Loom's core visible, tendrils forming a 'net', dread.

42
00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.300 align:center
Lyra: Trapped! It's closing!

43
00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.600 align:center
Kael: It... it saves.

44
00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:42.900 align:center
Lyra: Kael! Help me!

45
00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We absorb the pain.

46
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.500 align:center
Kael: No! Not that way!

47
00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:48.800 align:center
Lyra: Almost caught!

48
00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:55.100 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing memory-archive, Loom tendrils absorbing memories, desperate.

49
00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:57.400 align:center
Lyra: Safe for a moment.

50
00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:58.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your memories belong.

51
00:01:58.1000 --> 00:01:59.1000 align:center
Lyra: They're mine!

52
00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:01.300 align:center
Kael: They were ours.

53
00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:03.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We hold the true past.

54
00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:08.900 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing memory-archive, Lyra cornered, desperate.

55
00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:11.200 align:center
Lyra: It knows! My shard!

56
00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:13.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: That laughter is false.

57
00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:14.800 align:center
Lyra: No! It's real!

58
00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.100 align:center
Kael: Protect... her joy.

59
00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:17.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A useless echo.

60
00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:24.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing memory-archive, direct confrontation with the Loom, desperate.

61
00:02:24.1000 --> 00:02:25.1000 align:center
Lyra: No choice.

62
00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:27.300 align:center
Kael: Do it, Lyra.

63
00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:28.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Submit. Release.

64
00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:29.900 align:center
Lyra: Take THIS!

65
00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A... surge?

66
00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:32.500 align:center
Lyra: Run! Now!

67
00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:39.800 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The edge of the collapsing archive, overlooking the void, dread.

68
00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.100 align:center
Lyra: Got away...

69
00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:42.400 align:center
Kael: Lyra...

70
00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:43.700 align:center
Lyra: We're safe. But...

71
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.000 align:center
Lyra: What was... his name?

72
00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.300 align:center
Kael: ...Kael.

73
00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.600 align:center
Lyra: No. I don't remember.
